  "contentHtml": "\n\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Experience matchless flexibility of working while sipping your coffee. That too, from the comfort of your luxurious home in Abu Dhabi. This privilege can be yours with the </span><b>2-year Freelance Visa Abu Dhabi</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">. You can legally build your freelancing career and leverage the digital incentives that this city’s government has to offer.&nbsp; This guide will cover everything you need to know, from eligibility to the latest 2025 updates, so you can start your freelance journey with confidence.</span></p>\n<h2 id=\"why-choose-a-2-years-freelance-visa-abu-dhabi\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Why choose a 2 years freelance visa Abu Dhabi?</span></h2>\n<p><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The Ultimate Freedom to Work in the UAE!</span></i></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The UAE has been a rich platform that offers a dynamic environment for freelancers, entrepreneurs, and digital nomads. Freelancing has been a preferred working choice among the grown remote work trends and flexible work arrangements. Here’s why a </span><b>2 years freelance visa in&nbsp; Abu Dhabi</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> is the best option for independent professionals in 2025:</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Legally work and live in the UAE without a company sponsor.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Access to UAE’s booming economy and high-paying clients.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Freedom to choose your projects and set your rates.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Open a UAE bank account and get financial credibility.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Apply for family sponsorship to bring your dependents.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"who-can-apply-for-a-2-years-freelance-visa-abu-dhabi\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Who can apply for a 2 years freelance visa Abu Dhabi?</span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Freelancing in Abu Dhabi is open to professionals from various industries. The visa is ideal for:</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Media professionals</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> including writers, designers, photographers, videographers</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Tech experts</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> including software developers, IT consultants, cybersecurity specialists</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Marketing specialists</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> covering SEO experts, social media managers, digital marketers</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Consultants and trainers</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> encompass business coaches, financial advisors, language instructors</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Healthcare and education professionals</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> including therapists, fitness trainers, private tutors</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Even if your field isn’t listed, there’s a high chance you qualify. Abu Dhabi’s freelance visa is designed to support a diverse range of professionals.</span></p>\n<h2 id=\"how-to-apply-for-a-2-years-freelance-visa-in-abu-dhabi\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">How to apply for a 2 years freelance visa in Abu Dhabi</span></h2>\n<p><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-23231\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/steps-to-apply-for-visa.webp\" alt=\"How to Apply for a 2 Years Freelance Visa in Abu Dhabi\" width=\"1000\" height=\"536\"><noscript><img fetchpriority=\"high\" fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-23231\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/steps-to-apply-for-visa.webp\" alt=\"How to Apply for a 2 Years Freelance Visa in Abu Dhabi\" width=\"1000\" height=\"536\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/steps-to-apply-for-visa.webp 1000w, /wp-content/uploads/2025/03/steps-to-apply-for-visa-300x161.webp 300w, /wp-content/uploads/2025/03/steps-to-apply-for-visa-768x412.webp 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\" /></noscript></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Secure a </span><b>2 years freelance visa Abu Dhabi</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> following these simplified steps. Fulfill each requirement and plan accordingly.</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"1-choose-your-freelance-activity\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">1. Choose your freelance activity</span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Check the list of approved freelance categories in Abu Dhabi to ensure your profession qualifies.</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"2-get-a-freelance-license\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">2. Get a <a href=\"/freelance-license-in-dubai/\">Freelance License</a></span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Before applying for the visa, you need to <em><a href=\"/freelance-work-permit/\">obtain a freelance permit</a></em> from a UAE free zone such as:</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>twofour54</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> (for media professionals)</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Abu Dhabi Department of Economic Development (ADDED)</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> (for other freelancers)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"3-gather-required-documents\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">3. Gather Required Documents</span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">You’ll need:</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Passport copy (valid for at least six months)</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Recent passport-size photo</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">UAE visa copy (if applicable)</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Proof of relevant experience (degree, certifications, portfolio)</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">No Objection Certificate (NOC) from current employer (if applicable)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"4-submit-your-application\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">4. Submit your application</span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Apply through Abu Dhabi’s official portals or trusted freelance visa providers.</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"5-pay-fees-and-await-approval\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">5. Pay fees and await approval</span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Once you submit the documents and make the necessary payments, processing usually takes </span><b>7-15 working days</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">.</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"6-get-your-visa-and-emirates-id\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">6. Get your visa and Emirates ID</span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">After approval, complete your medical test and Emirates ID registration. Once issued, you’re officially a freelancer in Abu Dhabi!</span></p>\n<h2 id=\"latest-trends-why-2025-is-the-best-year-to-go-freelance-in-abu-dhabi\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Latest trends: why 2025 is the best year to go Freelance in Abu Dhabi</span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The government backs the freelancing industries in Abu Dhabi. The advanced technological changes encourages digital enthusiast to live and work in this safe city. The demand for remote professionals has increased across the globe, making it perfect platform for freelancers.&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"1-rise-in-remote-work-opportunities\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">1. Rise in Remote Work Opportunities</span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">With more global companies hiring remote talent, freelancers in the UAE have access to international clients and projects.</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"2-government-support-for-freelancers\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">2. Government Support for Freelancers</span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The UAE is lowering barriers for independent workers. Promoting freelancing actively, this country brought new visa schemes to add more incentives.&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"3-tax-free-earnings\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">3. Tax-Free Earnings</span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Freelancers in Abu Dhabi enjoy </span><b>0% personal income tax</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, maximizing their earnings.</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"4-co-working-spaces-and-networking-hubs\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">4. Co-Working Spaces and Networking Hubs</span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Abu Dhabi gives rise to world-class co-working spaces equipped with complete amenities. This way, freelancers can collaborate and build their network with like-minded businessmen.</span></p>\n<h2 id=\"common-challenges-and-how-to-overcome-them\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Common challenges and how to overcome them</span></h2>\n<h3 id=\"finding-clients\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Finding Clients</span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Securing consistent projects is one of the biggest concerns for freelancers. To overcome this:</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Utilize </span><b>popular freelance platforms</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> like Upwork, Fiverr, and PeoplePerHour.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Build a </span><b>professional portfolio website</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> to showcase your skills and attract direct clients.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Network through </span><b>social media and industry events</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> in Abu Dhabi.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Collaborate with </span><b>co-working spaces</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> like Hub71, where freelancers connect and find opportunities.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"managing-finances-and-taxes\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Managing Finances and Taxes</span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Handling finances independently can be overwhelming. Here’s how to stay on top of it:</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Open a </span><b>freelancer-friendly UAE bank account</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> that allows smooth transactions.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Use </span><b>invoicing and accounting tools</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> such as QuickBooks, FreshBooks, or Zoho.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Set aside savings for </span><b>health insurance and visa renewals</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> to avoid financial strain.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Seek guidance from </span><b>financial consultants</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> familiar with freelancer taxation in Abu Dhabi.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"visa-renewal-and-compliance\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visa Renewal and Compliance</span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Following the visa regulations and maintain compliance is mandatory to keep the work going without any disruption in the UAE. for this, follow these steps:</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Make sure to keep a check on the validity of</span> <span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">visa and expiry dates. If its soon to be expired, initiate renewal at least </span><b>one month in advance</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Keep your </span><b>freelance permit active</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> to avoid complications during the renewal process.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Ensure your </span><b>Emirates ID and health insurance remain valid</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> for a seamless renewal experience.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Stay updated with </span><b>freelance visa policies</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> by following Abu Dhabi’s official visa portals.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"balancing-work-and-lifestyle\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Balancing Work and Lifestyle</span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">While freelancing offers flexibility, it’s essential to maintain a healthy work-life balance:</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Create a </span><b>structured daily schedule</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> to enhance productivity.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Use </span><b>task management apps</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> like Trello, Asana, or Notion to organize projects.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Take advantage of Abu Dhabi’s </span><b>co-working spaces</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> for a professional work environment.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Allocate time for networking, skill development, and personal well-being.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"finding-clients-2\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Finding Clients</span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Leverage </span><b>freelance platforms</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> like Upwork, Fiverr, and LinkedIn.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Build a </span><b>strong portfolio</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> showcasing your work.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Attend networking events in Abu Dhabi.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"managing-finances\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Managing Finances</span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Open a </span><b>freelance-friendly UAE bank account</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Use invoicing and accounting tools like QuickBooks or Zoho.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"visa-renewal-process\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visa Renewal Process</span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Keep track of </span><b>visa expiry dates</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> to avoid penalties.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Maintain an active freelance permit to ensure renewal eligibility.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"ready-to-secure-your-2-years-freelance-visa-abu-dhabi\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Ready to secure your 2 years freelance visa Abu Dhabi?</span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The </span><b>2 years freelance visa Abu Dhabi</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> opens door to a flexible and independent career. This dynamic city enables creative professional, tech expert, or <em><a href=\"/freelance-business-consultant/\">freelance business consultant</a></em> to thrive in Abu Dhabi.</span></p>\n<h2 id=\"connect-freelance-your-hassle-free-visa-solution\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Connect Freelance – your hassle-free visa solution</span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Obtain your </span><b>2 years freelance visa Abu Dhabi</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> with a fast-track application process. </span><a href=\"/\"><b>Connect Freelance</b></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> is your ultimate solution for consistent guidance and chaos-free experience. We take care of everything from securing your freelance permit to handling visa paperwork. Build your freelance career in Abu Dhabi and tap into the endless incentives of a sustainable future.&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><b>Start your freelance journey today with Connect Freelance!</b></p>\n<h2 id=\"faqs\">FAQs</h2>\n<h3 id=\"what-is-the-2-year-freelance-visa-in-abu-dhabi\"><b>What is the 2-Year Freelance Visa in Abu Dhabi?</b></h3>\n<p><b></b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> It’s a residence visa valid for two years that allows independent professionals to live and legally work in the Emirate of Abu Dhabi without a company sponsor.</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"who-can-apply-for-the-2-year-freelance-visa-in-abu-dhabi\"><b>Who can apply for the 2-year freelance visa in Abu Dhabi?</b></h3>\n<p><b></b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Professionals in media, tech, marketing, consulting, healthcare, and education (e.g., writers, designers, developers, and trainers) are eligible. Even if your field is not listed, you may still qualify.</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"how-much-does-the-2-year-freelance-visa-cost-in-abu-dhabi\"><b>How much does the 2-year freelance visa cost in Abu Dhabi?</b></h3>\n<p><b></b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Typical total cost ranges from about AED 12,000 to AED 15,000 (including permit, visa stamping, ID, medical, and insurance), though exact figures depend on the free zone and service package.</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"what-are-the-benefits-of-the-2-year-freelance-visa-in-abu-dhabi\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">&nbsp;</span><b>What are the benefits of the 2-year freelance visa in Abu Dhabi?</b></h3>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Work for yourself and choose your projects.</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br>\n</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Live in the UAE legally with freelance status.</span><a href=\"/2-years-freelance-visa-abu-dhabi/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">&nbsp;</span></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Access to a bank account, residence benefits, and zero personal income tax.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"can-i-sponsor-my-family-with-a-2-year-freelance-visa-in-abu-dhabi\"><b>Can I sponsor my family with a 2-year freelance visa in Abu Dhabi?</b></h3>\n<p><b></b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Yes, the visa holder may sponsor family members, subject to the emirate’s income/salary and accommodation requirements.</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"is-the-2-year-freelance-visa-in-abu-dhabi-renewable\"><b>Is the 2-Year Freelance Visa in Abu Dhabi renewable?</b></h3>\n<p><b></b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Yes, after the validity ends (two years for the residence portion), you must renew your freelancer permit and visa to continue.</span><a href=\"https://roadtoremotey.com/abu-dhabi-freelance-visa-guide/?utm_source=chatgpt.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">&nbsp;</span></a><br>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"FAQPage\",\n  \"mainEntity\": [{\n    \"@type\": \"Question\",\n    \"name\": \"What is the 2-Year Freelance Visa in Abu Dhabi?\",\n    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n      \"text\": \"It’s a residence visa valid for two years that allows independent professionals to live and legally work in the Emirate of Abu Dhabi without a company sponsor.\"\n    }\n  },{\n    \"@type\": \"Question\",\n    \"name\": \"Who can apply for the 2-year freelance visa in Abu Dhabi?\",\n    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n      \"text\": \"Professionals in media, tech, marketing, consulting, healthcare, and education (e.g., writers, designers, developers, and trainers) are eligible. Even if your field is not listed, you may still qualify.\"\n    }\n  },{\n    \"@type\": \"Question\",\n    \"name\": \"How much does the 2-year freelance visa cost in Abu Dhabi?\",\n    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n      \"text\": \"Typical total cost ranges from about AED 12,000 to AED 15,000 (including permit, visa stamping, ID, medical, and insurance), though exact figures depend on the free zone and service package.\"\n    }\n  },{\n    \"@type\": \"Question\",\n    \"name\": \"What are the benefits of the 2-year freelance visa in Abu Dhabi?\",\n    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n      \"text\": \"Work for yourself and choose your projects.</p>\n<p>Live in the UAE legally with freelance status. \nAccess to a bank account, residence benefits, and zero personal income tax.\"\n    }\n  },{\n    \"@type\": \"Question\",\n    \"name\": \"Can I sponsor my family with a 2-year freelance visa in Abu Dhabi?\",\n    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n      \"text\": \"Yes, the visa holder may sponsor family members, subject to the emirate’s income/salary and accommodation requirements.\"\n    }\n  },{\n    \"@type\": \"Question\",\n    \"name\": \"Is the 2-Year Freelance Visa in Abu Dhabi renewable?\",\n    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n      \"text\": \"Yes, after the validity ends (two years for the residence portion), you must renew your freelancer permit and visa to continue.\"\n    }\n  }]\n}\n</script></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n                \n                    <!--begin code -->\n\n                    \n                    <div class=\"pp-multiple-authors-boxes-wrapper pp-multiple-authors-wrapper pp-multiple-authors-layout-boxed multiple-authors-target-the-content box-post-id-22816 box-instance-id-1 ppma_boxes_22816\" data-post_id=\"22816\" data-instance_id=\"1\" data-additional_class=\"pp-multiple-authors-layout-boxed.multiple-authors-target-the-content\" data-original_class=\"pp-multiple-authors-boxes-wrapper pp-multiple-authors-wrapper box-post-id-22816 box-instance-id-1\">\n                                                                                    <h2 class=\"widget-title box-header-title\" id=\"author\">Author</h2>\n                                                                            <span class=\"ppma-layout-prefix\"></span>\n                        <div class=\"ppma-author-category-wrap\">\n                                                                                                                                    <span class=\"ppma-category-group ppma-category-group-1 category-index-0\">\n                                                                                                                        <ul class=\"pp-multiple-authors-boxes-ul author-ul-0\">\n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    \n                                                                                                                    <li class=\"pp-multiple-authors-boxes-li author_index_0 author_mehvish-beg has-avatar\">\n                                                                                                                                                                                    <div class=\"pp-author-boxes-avatar\">\n                                                                    <div class=\"avatar-image\">\n                                                                                                                                                                                                                <img alt=\"Mehvish Beg\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/Mehvish-Beg-80x80.png\" class=\"avatar avatar-80 photo\" height=\"80\" width=\"80\"><noscript><img alt='Mehvish Beg' src='/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/Mehvish-Beg-80x80.png' srcset='/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/Mehvish-Beg-160x160.png 2x' class='avatar avatar-80 photo' height='80' width='80' /></noscript>                                                                                                                                                                                                            </div>\n                                                                                                                                    </div>\n                                                            \n                                                            <div class=\"pp-author-boxes-avatar-details\">\n                                                                <div class=\"pp-author-boxes-name multiple-authors-name\"><a href=\"/author/mehvish-beg/\" rel=\"author\" title=\"Mehvish Beg\" class=\"author url fn\">Mehvish Beg</a></div>                                                                                         